            "value": "CouchSubs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs TV app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs TV app"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs TV uygulaması"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs, geliştirici modunun süresini her kullanışınızda kendisi uzatır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs, Sony Interactive Entertainment ile bağlantılı değildir. PlayStation ve PS5, Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.'in ticari markalarıdır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows a Turkish translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows a Turkish translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs, PS5 oyunlarınızın İngilizce altyazısını okur ve Türkçesini TV'de oyunun üstünde gösterir. Siz TV'de kendi kolunuzla oynamaya devam edersiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs translates on this computer, without the internet. The English–Turkish model (about 530 MB) is downloaded once and kept on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs translates on this computer, without the internet. The English–Turkish model (about 530 MB) is downloaded once and kept on this computer."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs çeviriyi bu bilgisayarda, internetsiz yapar. İngilizce–Türkçe model (yaklaşık 530 MB) bir kez indirilir ve bu bilgisayarda kalır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs oyunu Uzaktan Oynatma ile izler. Kendi hesabınızı kullansaydı PS5 kolunuzu kapatırdı. İkinci bir hesapla oyununuz hiç bölünmez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CouchSubs will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs TV'nize örnek bir altyazı gönderecek. Ekranın altında, oyunun üstünde görünmeli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not download %@. Check the internet connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not download %@. Check the internet connection and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ indirilemedi. İnternet bağlantısını denetleyip yeniden deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not translate this area.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not translate this area."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu alan çevrilemedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a free account at playstation.com with a different email address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a free account at playstation.com with a different email address."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "playstation.com'da farklı bir e-posta adresiyle ücretsiz bir hesap açın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debugging was not allowed on the TV. Try again and choose Allow on the TV.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Debugging was not allowed on the TV. Try again and choose Allow on the TV."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de hata ayıklamaya izin verilmedi. Yeniden deneyin ve TV'de İzin ver'i seçin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer Mode is on. One last step to install the TV app:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer Mode is on. One last step to install the TV app:"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu açık. TV uygulamasını kurmak için son bir adım kaldı:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer Mode: %lld hours left. CouchSubs extends it by itself each time you use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer Mode: %lld hours left. CouchSubs extends it by itself each time you use it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu: %lld saat kaldı. CouchSubs süreyi her kullanışınızda kendisi uzatır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you see it on the TV?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do you see it on the TV?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de görüyor musunuz?"
          }
        }
